# Sheet gradient

Use `sheetGradientColors` from `src/theme/sheetGradient.ts` for the shared
bottom-sheet and rest-timer fade.

Do not redefine its `bg-trans-1` → `content-trans-light` colors in components.

Add, edit, and delete sheets inherit this fade through `AppBottomSheet`.
